  "description": "After being ripped from the spiritual world and implanted in a doll by sorcerers, Perrie's only wish is to return to the afterlife. But when dying proves to be impossible with her current indestructible body, she encounters the Demon King, who suggests that his son Julian is capable of giving her the death she desires. The only catch? She has to raise and protect him from other demons who want the throne! Will Perrie get what she wants, or will death always be out of reach for her?\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
